"值班怎样工作：自己不改文件，要改的事派成任务，只有你能决定的才问你；还有工作区共享资料和它记下的状态。" = "How a Loop works: it does not change files itself, dispatches what needs changing as runs, and asks you only what only you can decide; plus the workspace's shared context and the state it saved.";
