"每天" = "Every day";
"分拣 GitHub issue" = "Triage GitHub issues";
"用 gh 看 <owner/repo> 新开和有更新的 issue。能复现的 bug 和范围清楚的需求派成任务，key 用 github:<owner/repo>#<编号>；只是提问的，直接在 issue 下回答；需求不清楚的问我。" = "Use gh to look at new and updated issues in <owner/repo>. Dispatch reproducible bugs and well-scoped requests as runs, with the key github:<owner/repo>#<number>; answer plain questions right in the issue; ask me when a request is unclear.";
"每天看 CI" = "Check CI daily";
"看 <owner/repo> 主分支最近的 CI。有失败就找出原因：能修的派成任务，key 用 ci:<运行编号>；偶发的先记下来，连续出现再派。" = "Look at the latest CI runs on the main branch of <owner/repo>. When something fails, find out why: dispatch what can be fixed as a run, with the key ci:<run number>; note flaky failures and dispatch them once they repeat.";
"盯依赖更新" = "Watch dependencies";
"看项目的依赖有没有新版本。补丁版本直接派成升级任务；大版本先读更新说明，有破坏性改动的问我。key 用 dep:<包名>@<版本>。" = "Check the project's dependencies for new versions. Dispatch patch upgrades right away; for major versions read the release notes first and ask me about breaking changes. Use the key dep:<package>@<version>.";
