"按这台 Mac 的时间（%@）。到点时它还在干活，就等这次干完再来一次；Mac 睡眠时错过的，Mac 醒来后只补一次。它也可以自己约一次时间表之外的开工，比如等 CI 跑完再看，值班页上会写明时间和原因。" = "In this Mac's time (%@). If it is still awake when a time comes, it wakes again once that wake ends; times missed while the Mac sleeps are made up once. It can also ask to wake once outside the schedule, for example to look again after CI finishes; the Loop's page shows when and why.";
